<Item XName="PolarizationEllipse" UserName="PolarizationEllipse" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% Polarization Ellipse Graph equations&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;k=0:359&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;if ( ( length( Etheta ) == 1 ) &amp;&amp; ( length( Ephi ) == 1 ) )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;EthetaN = Etheta / sqrt( abs( Etheta )^2 + abs( Ephi )^2 );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;EphiN = Ephi / sqrt( abs( Etheta )^2 + abs( Ephi )^2 );&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;EthetaVsTime = real(EthetaN * exp(j*2*pi*k/360));&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;EphiVsTime = real(EphiN * exp(j*2*pi*k/360));&#x000D;&#x000A;else&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;error( &apos;PolarizationEllipse equations not defined when Etheta and Ephi are arrays.&apos; );&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
